<p>Let it snow, Let it snow, Let it snow&#8230;</p>
<p>With thanks to all those in the chat who read this:</p>
<p>-Chicken<br />
-Hippo<br />
-red-rogue<br />
-MaliceAfterthought<br />
-SpookyPizza<br />
-AidenEldritch<br />
-Freaky<br />
-Timberbuff</p>
<p>Thanks also to Cimmerian, who suggested getting rid of all my blackboxes.</p>
<p>This is easily the most ambitious SCP I've attempted thus far, so I'm sure it's going to garner a hefty number of downvotes. I completely understand such a decision :p.</p>
<p>Regarding the images:</p>
<p>-The image in Document 1 is found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blizzard1_-_NOAA.jpg">here</a>, and is in the public domain.<br />
-The image in Document 2 is found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Snowflake9.png">here</a>, and is in the public domain.<br />
-The image in Document 3 is found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blizzard2_-_NOAA.jpg">here</a>, and is in the public domain.<br />
-The image in Document 4 is found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USS_Philippine_Sea_(CV-47)_flight_deck_with_snow_Nov_1950.jpg">here</a>, and is in the public domain.</p>

